    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d539">

                <pb facs="0475" n="401" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg401"/>

                <head>Mr. F. W. Seward to Mr. van Limburg</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-04-08"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >April</hi> 8, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir:</hi> I have received your note of
                    yesterday, and I thank you for the friendly expressions which it contains
                    concerning the late accident to the Secretary of State. I am happy to announce
                    that, though still suffering much pain, his wounds have thus far been attended
                    by no unfavorable symptoms, and that hopes of his speedy recovery are
                    confidently entertained by his attending physicians.</p>
                <p>Very faithfully, yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>F. W. SEWARD. <hi rendition="#italic">Acting
                    Secretary</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Roest van Limburg</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c.,&amp;c., New York.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
